"<h2>Cơ chế chống xung đột Split-Brain</h2>\n<p>Khi cơ sở dữ liệu Nitrobase được khôi phục sang máy chủ mới, hệ thống sẽ tự động khởi động ở trạng thái <strong>Tạm dừng (Paused)</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Các tác vụ dở dang không tự động chạy lại.</li>\n<li>Lịch sao lưu tự động tạm thời dừng.</li>\n<li>Khóa việc triển khai ứng dụng mới.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Cơ chế này ngăn việc cả 2 máy chủ (cũ và mới) cùng điều khiển một hạ tầng gây hư hại dữ liệu. Quản trị viên chỉ cần bấm <strong>\"This database was moved — resume here\"</strong> để chính thức bàn giao quyền điều khiển.</p>\n<h2>Khôi phục thủ công qua Terminal</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. Giải mã file sao lưu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openssl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> enc</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -aes-256-cbc</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -pbkdf2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -md</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sha256</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -iter</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200000</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -pass</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> env:ENCRYPTION_KEY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -in</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> backup.tar.gz.enc</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tar</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -xzf</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> -</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. Nạp dữ liệu vào container Postgres</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker-compose.prod.yml</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> exec</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -T</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> postgres</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  psql</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -U</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nitrobase</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nitrobase</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nitrobase-backup/nitrobase.sql</span></span></code></pre>"